<title>CHINA: GOLD-FACE YEAR PROFIT RISES 56.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>GOLD-FACE YEAR PROFIT RISES 56.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   12.8   vs 8.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.5    vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    85.69  vs 54.76</p>
<p>    Turnover		     266.04 vs 258.32</p>
<p>    Company name		 Gold-Face Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 15-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 24</p>
<p>NOTE - Gold-Face engages in property development and investment, property management and project development and management.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one-for-five shares held.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is five H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.5 cents) vs four cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
